# Copy to `.env.preprod` (git-ignored) and fill in exactly ONE of the two secrets.
#
# The wallet must hold tNIGHT and spendable DUST on Preprod. Get tNIGHT from the
# faucet page below; the deploy/test scripts will also try the programmatic drip
# endpoint (https://faucet.preprod.midnight.network/api/drips) and will register
# NIGHT UTXOs for DUST generation automatically.
#
# NEVER commit `.env.preprod`. It is listed in .gitignore.

# Faucet (human-facing): https://midnight-tmnight-preprod.nethermind.dev/

# Set ONE of the following, and delete the other:
MIDNIGHT_PREPROD_SEED=replace-with-a-64-char-hex-seed
# MIDNIGHT_PREPROD_MNEMONIC=replace with a 24 word mnemonic

# Optional overrides
# MIDNIGHT_PROOF_SERVER=http://127.0.0.1:6300
# LOG_LEVEL=info

# Auction parameters used by `npm run deploy:preprod`
# MIDNIGHT_RESERVE_PRICE=1000
